{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CH","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"歷代志下","commonName":"歷代志下","title":"歷代志下","order":14,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"1d3083ee25a929eff6f02adb22f6b1846af8655beae8503d113456603ae82122","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CH/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":821},"chapter":{"number":27,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["猶大王約坦"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["約坦登基的時候年二十五歲，在耶路撒冷作王十六年，他母親名叫耶路沙，是撒督的女兒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["約坦行耶和華眼中看為正的事，效法他父烏西雅一切所行的，只是不入耶和華的殿。百姓還行邪僻的事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["約坦建立耶和華殿的上門，在俄斐勒城上多有建造，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["又在猶大山地建造城邑，在樹林中建築營寨和高樓。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["約坦與亞捫人的王打仗勝了他們，當年他們進貢銀一百他連得，小麥一萬歌珥，大麥一萬歌珥；第二年、第三年也是這樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["約坦在耶和華－他上帝面前行正道，以致日漸強盛。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["約坦其餘的事和一切爭戰，並他的行為，都寫在以色列和猶大列王記上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他登基的時候年二十五歲，在耶路撒冷作王十六年。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["約坦與他列祖同睡，葬在大衛城裏。他兒子亞哈斯接續他作王。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CH/27.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CH/28.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CH/26.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}